# Downloaded third-party reference repositories (opencode, models.dev, hermes, ...)
# — kept outside the repo (~/Desktop/ai-os-references); only generated output is
# committed. The patterns below ignore *subdirectories* of the harness agent
# folders, so a re-downloaded reference repo can never be committed while our
# own agent definitions (index.ts / persona.ts) stay tracked.
src/kernel/agents/DeepSeekHarnessAgent/*/
src/kernel/agents/HermessAgent/*/
src/kernel/agents/HermessAgent/*/
src/kernel/agents/OpenClawAgent/*/
src/kernel/agents/OpenCodeAgent/*/

